>
<Nav /><section class="section hero mint-blue tools"><div class="container__01"><div class="hero-wrapper align-top"><div class="hero-content margin-top"><h1 class="h1-heading">Success Stories</h1><div class="hero-paragraph-title">Inspiring stories of justice and compensation.</div><p class="paragraph__19 margin-64">Inspiring success stories of clients who received justice and compensation with the dedicated representation of TBW Law Firm. Discover how our expertise in personal injury law has positively impacted lives.</p></div><div class="hero-image-wrapper hero-image-45"><img src="/images/ss_01.jpg" loading="lazy" width="559" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 40vw" alt="" srcset="/images/ss_01-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/ss_01.jpg 560w" class="hero-image"><div class="absolute-image-wrapper animate"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section content-12"><div class="container__01"><div class="flexbox-wrapper _02 c-right"><div class="image-wrapper auto-height image-40"><img src="/images/ss2.jpg" loading="lazy" width="514" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 35vw" alt="" srcset="/images/ss2-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/ss2.jpg 515w" class="image-section"></div><div class="content-wrapper width-40 right"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-15">RomanFamily Wins $21 Million Dollars from <br>U-Haul..</h2><p class="paragraph">In a landmark victory, TBW Law secured a $21.2 million verdict for the Roman family against U-Haul. The case involved a U-Haul employee's negligent driving, which led to a head-on collision causing severe injuries to Mr. Roman. <br><br>Despite the defense's attempts to minimize damages, the jury awarded substantial compensation for pain, suffering, and medical expenses. This success exemplifies TBW Law's dedication to achieving justice for their clients.</p><a href="https://tbwlawfirm.webflow.io/blog/roman-family-awarded-21-2-million-in-u-haul-negligence-case" class="button-9 w-button">Learn More</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section content-02 orange"><div class="container__01"><div class="flexbox-wrapper c-left"><div class="content-wrapper width-42"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-15">$12.5 Million Dollar Win for the Hernandez Family.</h2><p class="paragraph margin-40">Attorney Ted Wacker of TBW Law secured a $12.65 million settlement for a college soccer player severely injured by a speeding semi-truck. The accident occurred on I-605 when the plaintiff's vehicle stalled on the highway and was struck by a reckless semi-truck driver, resulting in brain hemorrhaging and multiple fractures. <br><br>Although an initial offer of $3 million, Attorney Wacker utilized witness testimony and a detailed collision reconstruction to highlight the defendant's negligence and achieve a significantly greater settlement, ensuring justice and financial security for his client.<br><br></p><a href="https://youtu.be/fk4wJjcSLrM" target="_blank" class="button-9 w-button">Watch Video</a></div><div class="image-wrapper auto-height"><img src="/images/ss3.png" loading="lazy" width="602" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 41vw" alt="" srcset="/images/ss3-p-500.png 500w, /images/ss3.png 515w" class="section-image"></div></div></div></section><section class="section content-13"><div class="container__01"><div class="flexbox-wrapper c-right"><div class="image-wrapper image-50"><img src="/images/ss5.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 44vw" srcset="/images/ss5-p-500.png 500w, /images/ss5.png 625w" alt="" class="image-section"></div><div class="content-wrapper width-40 right"><h2 class="h2-heading">Condon Family Receives $7 Million Dollars for Injuries.</h2><p class="paragraph">TBW Law successfully secured justice for Mr. Condon, who suffered a below-the-knee amputation after a motorcycle accident, initially marked by completely adverse liability in the police report. <br><br>In spite of significant challenges, TBW Law meticulously proved the defendant's negligence, ensuring substantial compensation to support Mr. Condon's recovery and future needs.</p><a href="https://youtu.be/cCBH7VgbV-0" target="_blank" class="button-9 w-button">Watch Video</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section slider"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-25 fade-up">Real-client success stories</h2><p class="paragraph center has--margin-40">Positive experiences shared by clients, partners and our community.</p></div><div class="is--slider-whole"><div class="slider-arrow-wrapper fade-up"><div class="slider-arrows"><a id="left-button" fs-mirrorclick-element="trigger" href="#" class="arrow-circle-link left w-inline-block"><div class="arrow-circle left"><img src="/images/Line-45.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="arrow-icon-left"></div></a><a id="right-button" fs-mirrorclick-element="trigger-2" href="#" class="arrow-circle-link w-inline-block"><div class="arrow-circle"><img src="/images/Line-45.svg" loading="lazy" width="20" alt="" class="arrow-icon-right"></div></a></div></div><div id="basic-swiper" class="testimonials-slider-collection is--success-stories w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-8 swiper-wrapper is-succes--stories-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Ted was extremely professional, personable and knows the law well. I hired Ted 2 years ago, and he handled my Personal Injury matter. I had previously worked with 4 lawyers. We went to trial and the defense attorney for Wholefoods had met his match. If you need representation I highly recommend Ted!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Dr. Tom Bakman</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Words simply cannot express how much I appreciate all of your efforts on my behalf before and during trial. Your gentlemanly professionalism was obvious to everyone in that courtroom. I am so pleased that your schedule allowed you to work on my case—and do such a splendid job!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Patricia Heckhaus</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">I have known Ted for over 25 years and he has always been a hard-working and dedicated individual that I respect. Ted represented me in two cases and won both.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Tom</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">I am really thankful for the effort…I will never forget your dedication towards this case. You always wanted to make sure I get the best from this. Thank you so much! I just told my parents…they are thanking you so much for the work you have done for our family!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Karteek Koganti</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">My experience in this office was very pleasant, very good service, very attentive and friendly staff.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Gabriella Juarez</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Best lawyer I could ask for when it came to my car accident. Really fought to get to us what we needed and took care of our case.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Brittney Vigil</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Best lawyer you could need. Got my case settled in 6 months. I was able to be at home and recover and he took care of it.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">John Vigil</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><Footer /><!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

<!-- stagger-annimation -->
<style is:inline>
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 2 ) { transition-delay: .2s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 3 ) { transition-delay: .4s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 4 ) { transition-delay: .6s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 5 ) { transition-delay: .8s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 6 ) { transition-delay: 1.0s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 7 ) { transition-delay: 1.2s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 8 ) { transition-delay: 1.4s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 9 ) { transition-delay: 1.6s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 10 ) { transition-delay: 1.8s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 11 ) { transition-delay: 2.0s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 12 ) { transition-delay: 2.2s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 13 ) { transition-delay: 2.4s }
  .fade-in-up:nth-child( 14 ) { transition-delay: 2.6s }
  
  @media only screen and (max-width: 992px) {
    .fade-in-up {
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
  @media not all and (min-resolution:.001dpcm) {
    @supports (-webkit-appearance:none) and (stroke-color:transparent) {
      .fade-in-up {
        transform: none !important;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
<!-- stagger-annimation -->

<script is:inline>
$('[data-click="acordium-mb"]').click(function(){
  if(!$(this).is('.open')){
    $('[data-click="acordium-mb"].open').each((i, item)=>{
      item.click();
    });
    $(this).addClass('open');    
  }
  else{
    $(this).removeClass('open');
  }
});
  
$('[data-click="acordium-footer"]').click(function(){
  if(!$(this).is('.open')){
    $('[data-click="acordium-footer"].open').each((i, item)=>{
      item.click();
    });
    $(this).addClass('open');    
  }
  else{
    $(this).removeClass('open');
  }
});  
</script>

<!--START-Cloneable Custom Code-->
<script is:inline>
$('[data-click="menu"]').click(function(){
  if(!$(this).is('.open')){
    $('[data-click="menu"].open').each((i, item)=>{
      item.click();
    });
    $(this).addClass('open');    
  }
  else{
    $(this).removeClass('open');
  }
});
</script>
<!--END-Cloneable Custom Code-->

<!-- [Attributes by Finsweet] Disable scrolling -->

<script is:inline>
window.onscroll = function() {
  var topBar = document.querySelector(".top-bar");
  var bodyHeight = document.body.offsetHeight - window.innerHeight;
  var scrollPercentage = (document.documentElement.scrollTop / bodyHeight) * 100;

  if (scrollPercentage >= 3) {
    topBar.classList.remove("out");
  } else {
    topBar.classList.add("out");
  }
};

var dropdownWrapper = document.querySelector(".dropdown-wrapper");
var dropdownToggleWrapper = document.querySelector(".dropdown-toggle-wrapper");

dropdownWrapper.addEventListener("mouseout", function() {
  dropdownToggleWrapper.style.color = "inherit";
});

</script>

<script is:inline>
$('.dropdown-wrapper').hover(function(){
  $('[colour-nav-hover="black"]').addClass('black');
}, function(){
  $('[colour-nav-hover="black"]').removeClass('black');
});



let menuItems = document.querySelectorAll('[accordion="menu"]');
let hamburger = document.querySelector('.mb-menu-hamburger');
let logo = document.querySelector('.logo-svg-embed');
let turncolorElements = document.querySelectorAll('[turncolor="is-black"]');
let logoClassAdded = false;

for (let i = 0; i < menuItems.length; i++) {
  menuItems[i].addEventListener('click', function () {
    for (let j = 0; j < turncolorElements.length; j++) {
      turncolorElements[j].classList.toggle('is--black-acordium');
    }
  });
}

</script>
